    "id": "163821",
    "original": "私の兄は、未婚なので、所帯を持たず、奉公人と一緒によその家で食事をしていた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "250689",
        "text": "My brother, being yet unmarried, did not keep house, but boarded with his apprentices at the home of another family."
